WEBVTT

00:14.595 --> 00:19.638
The 545 Maroon Express was a logistical

00:19.658 --> 00:25.823
mistake. A 30-minute highway ride was not a

00:25.963 --> 00:31.724
clever risk to take. It beat the crowds, it saved

00:31.904 --> 00:38.547
us seeds, but left us in the freeze. A 45-minute

00:38.687 --> 00:44.430
wait outside is an unacceptable disease. The

00:44.510 --> 00:48.832
variable has changed. His health is the

00:48.892 --> 00:55.555
priority. The system must be optimized for

00:55.615 --> 00:57.696
sustainability.

00:59.566 --> 01:05.690
The new normal is 6 a.m. A new alarm, a brand new

01:05.790 --> 01:10.853
plan. Route one local, a slower pace. A

01:10.933 --> 01:15.435
45-minute ride, a safer space. A 15-minute wait

01:15.896 --> 01:22.239
is all we get. A logical and warmer set. This is

01:22.299 --> 01:25.781
the system, this is the shield The old

01:25.941 --> 01:29.802
inefficiency must yield

01:36.725 --> 01:41.306
It stops at every local street It stops at the New

01:41.366 --> 01:46.769
River Mall It's not as fast, it's not expressed,

01:46.869 --> 01:53.094
but it's the logical call. We beat the rush, we

01:53.134 --> 01:57.237
beat the cold, we're safe inside the library.

01:58.838 --> 02:06.043
Before the 7am wave, a perfect victory, the

02:06.103 --> 02:10.444
variable has changed. His health is the

02:10.484 --> 02:17.157
priority. The system must be optimized for

02:17.197 --> 02:19.361
sustainability.

02:21.166 --> 02:27.289
The new normal is 6 a.m. A new alarm, a brand new

02:27.429 --> 02:33.412
plan Route 1 local, a slower pace A 45-minute

02:33.472 --> 02:38.854
ride, a safer space A 15-minute wait is all we get

02:39.334 --> 02:45.017
A logical and warm message This is the system,

02:45.037 --> 02:50.540
this is the shield. The old inefficiency must

02:50.600 --> 02:51.181
yield.

02:59.826 --> 03:04.348
System is stable. GU protocol is active.

03:06.209 --> 03:08.831
Optimal solution found.

